<Layout title="About — Fusionedge">
<article class="story">
  <h1>About FusionEdge</h1>
  <p class="story-lead">FusionEdge is a modern facility management and workplace operations platform designed for organisations managing complex, multi-site environments.</p>
  <p>As businesses grow, operational challenges multiply — disconnected tools, manual tracking, delayed approvals, and limited visibility across locations. FusionEdge addresses this by bringing people, processes, assets, and data together on one integrated platform.</p>
  <p>By replacing spreadsheets and fragmented systems with real-time visibility and automation, FusionEdge helps organisations operate efficiently, make data-driven decisions, and scale without operational chaos.</p>

  <h2>What we've built</h2>
  <p>FusionEdge is a next-generation integrated facility management and workplace operations solution built to serve as a single source of truth across your organisation. The platform connects attendance, visitor management, asset tracking, maintenance, inventory, approvals, compliance, and analytics, so teams and sites can work from the same information.</p>

  <h2>Mission</h2>
  <p>To simplify facility and workplace operations through connected systems, intelligent automation, and real-time visibility.</p>

  <h2>Vision</h2>
  <p>As businesses grow, problems don't get smaller — systems need to get smarter.</p>

  <h2>The team</h2>
  <p>Leadership at FusionEdge brings together technical, operational, and enterprise experience. The team has built and scaled technology across industries, with a focus on cloud platforms, digital operations, and turning a product vision into something teams can run every day.</p>
